                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "47a1c74a-c1c4-325d-9f88-35de3a00c7ee",
                        "entry_id": "95591e9b-9059-35ac-aaa5-c1ee3f3c4f19",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having the status, rank or qualities of a queen; regal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "49ac8354-c3db-407d-a7ee-08ac4705a2ee",
                                "sense_id": "47a1c74a-c1c4-325d-9f88-35de3a00c7ee",
                                "text": "So Maggie, glad of anything that would soothe her mother, and cheer their long day together, consented to the vain decoration, and showed a queenly head above her old frocks, steadily refusing, however, to look at herself in the glass."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02e6493a-b54c-483c-9ad4-9529a65be179",
                                "sense_id": "47a1c74a-c1c4-325d-9f88-35de3a00c7ee",
                                "text": "There was an innate refinement, a languid queenly hauteur about Gerty which was unmistakably evidenced in her delicate hands and higharched instep."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84dd7276-e599-487a-95bf-3ad8d17e64ec",
                                "sense_id": "47a1c74a-c1c4-325d-9f88-35de3a00c7ee",
                                "text": "I'm so sorry. If I'd done my queenly duties right, none of this would have happened. But maybe I can fix it with some wish help."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62fe991c-2e2e-35be-b49c-b6b2f6c66407",
                        "entry_id": "95591e9b-9059-35ac-aaa5-c1ee3f3c4f19",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a queen (a typically feminine gay man); queenish."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8a12879-0e16-4245-af92-d4dec972cfe2",
                                "sense_id": "62fe991c-2e2e-35be-b49c-b6b2f6c66407",
                                "text": "The Pet Shop Boys are yet another synth-pop duo, albeit one that is not quite out of the closet. […] In past interviews, however, they [the Pet Shop Boys] have referred to their sound as \"specifically gay disco,\" and their lyrics have that certain queenly something that lead singer Neil Tennant sings with an adorable sibilance."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
